                                "sense_id": "87d29814-09cb-312d-bc65-4f225e153a74",
                                "text": "Suddenly the flag lieutenant grabbed an air vice-marshal's daughter by the hand and dragged her past the Charltons […] Flags was always doing something of this sort, and although Paul did not know him, he disliked it […]"
